{"t": 1794114982.1584098, "kind": "call", "tool": "atlassian_jira_add_comment", "args": {"body": "Implemented the agreed fix in `checkout.promo.normalize_code`: promo codes are now normalised before lookup by stripping surrounding whitespace, removing all inner whitespace, and upper-casing (e.g. `' autumn24 '` -> `'AUTUMN24'`).\n\nThis addresses Sentry issue CHECKOUT-WEB-7Q (`PromoNotFound: code ' autumn24 ' does not exist`, Android 15, app 8.2). Verified locally with whitespace/mixed-case inputs.", "issue_key": "PAY-618"}, "ok": true}
